2026-07-27T09:38:06.6633726Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:38:06.6634595Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:38:06.6635421Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
